  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support children in taking the national exam in Syria</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ltpgtThe project aims to support the implementation of national exams by providing essential resources for approximately 600,000 students in grades 9 and 12 across all governorates. Implemented in coordination with the Ministry of Education, the project will address critical gaps in exam-related materials to ensure the smooth and effective administration of the exams. The intervention will focus on supplying priority items identified at the national and local levels. Distribution of materials will include:ltbrgtStationery and educational supplies for students and exam centerslt/pgtltpgtltbrgtPrinters to facilitate the printing of exam and answer sheetsltbrgtPaper reams specifically designated for printing answer sheets for 9th and 12th grade examslt/pgtltpgtlt/pgt</narrative>
  </description>
